OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wed 7 Oct to Fri 16 Oct
OL,6,FCloudy with some rain in the far
OL,7,Fsoutheast and heavy showers in the far
OL,8,Fnorth, but otherwise a good deal of
OL,9,Ffine and dry weather at the start of
OL,10,Fthis period. This will quickly change
OL,11,Fas weather systems move in from the
OL,12,FAtlantic at the end of next week and
OL,13,Fover the following weekend. These will
OL,14,Fbring spells of rain or showers to
OL,15,Fmost areas, heavy at times (especially
OL,16,Fin the northwest) with some strong
OL,17,Fwinds. Into the middle of the month,
OL,18,Fsimilarly changeable conditions are
OL,19,Fmost likely, with a mixture of
OL,20,FAtlantic weather systems interspersed
OL,21,Fwith some drier, brighter spells.
OL,22,FTemperatures will likely be near to or
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fslightly below normal at first, maybe
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Fbecoming warmer later.
